#: PR2388_ExampleTreePrompt.py:300
msgid ""
"Gramps without any family tree data can feel like an unfurnished room.\n"
"\n"
"Would you like to import a <b>practice Family Tree</b>? This small sample "
"family lets you try out Gramps features (people, events, places, media, and "
"maps) before you enter your own family information.\n"
"\n"
"Changes you make to the practice tree will not affect your own trees."
msgstr ""

